  <data name="label8.Text" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>We provide solutions to accelerate BIM deployment and
management in Revit such as Hanger, Piping, Ducting, Fire
Protection.
Our solution aims to speed up deployment, save deployment
time, and optimize work performance for BIM engineers.
Flash BIM solutions support from the design and construction
stages to future maintenance and operations.</value>
